        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Thomas Francis Murphy, George Clooney, Marcy Holland, Greg Mitchell, Misty Talley, Allisyn Ashley Arm, Dave Davis, Michael Papajohn, Ross Britz, Ashton Leigh, Laura Cayouette\n- Works: True Detective, The Walking Dead, Leatherheads, Ghost Shark, Tracks, Ozark Sharks\n- Companies: Universal Pictures, Syfy\n\nFacts:\n- Leatherheads is a 2008 American sports comedy film from Universal Pictures that was directed by and starred George Clooney.\n- Tracks is a 2010 short film in which Thomas Francis Murphy had a role.\n- Thomas Francis Murphy is mostly known for roles in the television series True Detective and The Walking Dead, the film Leatherheads, the Syfy original film Ghost Shark, and the 2010 short film Tracks.\n- Ozark Sharks is a TV film written by Marcy Holland and Greg Mitchell and directed by Misty Talley.\n- Ozark Sharks stars Allisyn Ashley Arm, Dave Davis, Michael Papajohn, Ross Britz, Ashton Leigh, Thomas Francis Murphy, and Laura Cayouette.",
